Function : 
Function is a self contained block of statement. Every function performs some specific task.Function can be classified as : 
    a. User-defined function 
    b. Pre-defined function

a. User-defined function : 
    function whose definition part is defined by the programmer according to its programming needs.Ex : function addition(){...}

b. Pre-defined function : 
    function whose definition part is already defined.Pre-defined functions are also called as standard function or library function or in-built function or built-in function. Ex: pow(base,exponent) 

Advantages of function : 
    a. function reduces complexity of code 
    b. function reduces redundancy of code 
    c. function reduces program size 
    d. we can create n no. of functions
    e. a function can be called n no. of times 
    f. function makes debugging easier